        "id": 1006732
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-13T12:17:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The 15 x 40 \u003d 600s ceiling intentionally matches the prior fixed sleep, and the poll usually exits earlier now; RETRIES is never overridden in src, so a dedicated constant or monotonic deadline is a readability refactor we are declining under YAGNI.",
      "parentUuid": "edd0cc71_7911afe9",
      "revId": "764c7dd747b484c4929d10890330ae801cd41f8e",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
