      "writtenOn": "2026-11-13T11:00:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Treats an unreadable queue as a cleared one. `has_pending_bios_job()` returns False when a job GET is None, non-200, or unparsable (`badfish.py:1004-1012`), and `get_job_queue()` never checks the response status (`badfish.py:529-534`), so a 5xx or HTML body returns `[]`. Either path breaks this loop on the first iteration after the reboot, `change_boot` returns True with the boot order unapplied, and `reboot_for_rebuild` -\u003e `boot_to_type` -\u003e `boot_to` can then `clear_job_queue()` (`badfish.py:1156`) and drop the pending job. Treat an unreadable queue or job as still pending, or return None from the helper.",
      "revId": "764c7dd747b484c4929d10890330ae801cd41f8e",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
