      "writtenOn": "2026-11-13T12:17:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Confirmed reachable: a 503 or HTML body makes get_job_queue return [] and the poll exits on the first iteration. The root is shared get_job_queue not checking the response status and has_pending_bios_job treating an unreadable read as empty (pre-existing, also called at badfish.py:1238), so the fix belongs in that helper. Tracked as #767.",
      "parentUuid": "51f65447_666ccbbb",
      "revId": "764c7dd747b484c4929d10890330ae801cd41f8e",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
