      "writtenOn": "2026-11-13T11:00:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No log when the wait gives up: the loop exits silently after `self.retries` attempts and `change_boot` still returns True. `has_pending_bios_job()` also only matches New/Scheduled/Running, so a job ending Failed stops the wait and reads as success. A warning on exhaustion plus a final JobState read would leave a trace in the move log.",
      "revId": "764c7dd747b484c4929d10890330ae801cd41f8e",
